&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
  &lt;a href=&#34;https://getbootstrap.com/&#34;&gt;
    &lt;img src=&#34;https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/assets/brand/bootstrap-logo-shadow.png&#34; alt=&#34;Bootstrap logo&#34; width=&#34;200&#34; height=&#34;165&#34;&gt;
  &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;Bootstrap&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
  Sleek, intuitive, and powerful front-end framework for faster and easier web development.
  &lt;br&gt;
  &lt;a href=&#34;https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Explore Bootstrap docs »&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;br&gt;
  &lt;br&gt;
  &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/issues/new?assignees=-&amp;labels=bug&amp;template=bug_report.yml&#34;&gt;Report bug&lt;/a&gt;
  ·
  &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/issues/new?assignees=&amp;labels=feature&amp;template=feature_request.yml&#34;&gt;Request feature&lt;/a&gt;
  ·
  &lt;a href=&#34;https://blog.getbootstrap.com/&#34;&gt;Blog&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;bootstrap-5&#34;&gt;Bootstrap 5
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our default branch is for development of our Bootstrap 5 release. Head to the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/tree/v4-dev&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;code&gt;v4-dev&lt;/code&gt; branch&lt;/a&gt; to view the readme, documentation, and source code for Bootstrap 4.&lt;/p&gt;
