&lt;h2 id=&#34;quick-start&#34;&gt;Quick start
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Several quick start options are available:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/archive/v5.3.8.zip&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Download the latest release&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clone the repo: &lt;code&gt;git clone https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap.git&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install with &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.npmjs.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;npm&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;code&gt;npm install bootstrap@v5.3.8&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install with &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://yarnpkg.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;yarn&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;code&gt;yarn add bootstrap@v5.3.8&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install with &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://bun.sh/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Bun&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;code&gt;bun add bootstrap@v5.3.8&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install with &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://getcomposer.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Composer&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;code&gt;composer require twbs/bootstrap:5.3.8&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install with &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.nuget.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;NuGet&lt;/a&gt;: CSS: &lt;code&gt;Install-Package bootstrap&lt;/code&gt; Sass: &lt;code&gt;Install-Package bootstrap.sass&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Read the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/introduction/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Getting started page&lt;/a&gt; for information on the framework contents, templates, examples, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
